.TH WMSMOKE 1
.SH NAME
wmsmoke \- minimal window-manager smoke test
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/wmsmoke
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Wmsmoke
is a minimal Wm client used to sanity-check the window-manager
protocol itself: it connects, handles a
.B !reshape
request, and proves that it can obtain a real image and
.B /chan/wmrect
rather than exercising any application-level feature. A developer
diagnostic, not an end-user tool.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/wmsmoke.b
